    "designDecisionSummary": "Apple-inspired restrained palette: System Blue #007AFF primary, Space Black #1d1d1f ink, Silver Mist #f5f5f7 background. DM Sans for UI, JetBrains Mono for technical/mono. Global radius 1.2rem, pill buttons (rounded-full). Whisper-light shadows (0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04) at rest, 0 8px 24px on hover). Spacing base 0.24rem with scale 4/8/12/16/24/32/48/64/96/128. 1px borders define edges before shadow. App-shell desktop layout: top bar, sidebar, main content region with internal scroll.",
